OL,3,GNEWSANUFC agree to buy training ground
OL,4,Asite for #190m
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle United has announced it has
OL,7,Freached an agreement to purchase land
OL,8,Ffor a new #190m training ground.
OL,10,FThe club will acquire 260 acres (105
OL,11,Fhectares) of land at the Woolsington
OL,12,FHall estate owned by former chairman
OL,13,FSir John Hall, close to the city's
OL,14,Fairport.
OL,16,FA formal planning application for the
OL,17,Fnew elite performance facility and
OL,18,Facademy is expected to be submitted in
OL,19,Fearly 2027, with a view to the men's
OL,20,Ffirst team moving in for the 2029-30
OL,21,Fcampaign and flexibility to integrate
OL,22,Fbespoke women's facilities.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
